# Environment Variables Configuration

## Overview
This file documents all environment variables used in Kyndex.

---

## Backend Environment Variables

### Application Settings
```env
# General
NODE_ENV=development
PORT=3000
API_URL=http://localhost:3000
API_PREFIX=/api/v1
LOG_LEVEL=debug

# Frontend URL (for CORS)
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:3001
```

### Database
```env
# PostgreSQL
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://kyndex_user:kyndex_password@localhost:5432/kyndex_db?schema=public"
DATABASE_POOL_MIN=5
DATABASE_POOL_MAX=20
```

### Redis/Caching
```env
# Redis
REDIS_URL="redis://localhost:6379"
REDIS_PASSWORD=
REDIS_DB=0

# Cache TTL (in seconds)
CACHE_TTL_USER=3600
CACHE_TTL_SKILLS=86400
CACHE_TTL_MATCHING=1800
```

### Authentication
```env
# JWT
JWT_SECRET=your-super-secret-key-change-in-production
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=15m
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=your-refresh-secret-key-change-in-production
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRES_IN=7d

# OAuth Providers
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your-google-client-secret
GOOGLE_CALLBACK_URL=http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/oauth/google/callback

GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=your-github-client-id
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=your-github-client-secret
GITHUB_CALLBACK_URL=http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/oauth/github/callback
```

### Email Service
```env
# SendGrid
SENDGRID_API_KEY=your-sendgrid-key
SENDGRID_FROM_EMAIL=noreply@kyndex.com
SENDGRID_FROM_NAME=Kyndex

# Or use Resend
RESEND_API_KEY=your-resend-key
```

### Payment (Stripe)
```env
# Stripe
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_xxxx
STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_xxxx
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_test_xxxx
STRIPE_API_VERSION=2023-10-16

# Currency
DEFAULT_CURRENCY=EUR
```

### AI/LLM Services
```env
# OpenAI
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-xxxx
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4
OPENAI_ORG_ID=org-xxxx

# Or use local LLM (optional)
LOCAL_LLM_URL=http://localhost:8000
LOCAL_LLM_MODEL=llama2
```

### Third-party Services
```env
# Firebase (optional)
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your-project-id
FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY=your-private-key
FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL=your-service-account-email

# Sentry (error tracking)
SENTRY_DSN=https://xxxx@sentry.io/xxxx
SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=development
SENTRY_TRACES_SAMPLE_RATE=0.1

# Twilio (SMS - optional)
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=your-account-sid
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=your-auth-token
TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=+1234567890
```

### Elasticsearch (for search)
```env
# Elasticsearch
ELASTICSEARCH_URL=http://localhost:9200
ELASTICSEARCH_USERNAME=elastic
ELASTICSEARCH_PASSWORD=changeme
```

### AWS Services (if using AWS)
```env
# AWS
AWS_REGION=eu-west-1
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your-access-key
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your-secret-key

# S3 (file storage)
AWS_S3_BUCKET=kyndex-files
AWS_S3_REGION=eu-west-1

# SES (email alternative)
AWS_SES_REGION=eu-west-1
```

### Monitoring & Logging
```env
# Prometheus
PROMETHEUS_ENABLED=true
PROMETHEUS_PORT=9090

# Grafana
GRAFANA_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Structured Logging (Pino)
LOG_LEVEL=info
LOG_PRETTY=false
```

### RabbitMQ / Message Queue
```env
# RabbitMQ (for async jobs)
RABBITMQ_URL=amqp://admin:password@localhost:5672
RABBITMQ_QUEUE_PREFIX=kyndex_

# Or BullMQ with Redis
QUEUE_REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379
```

