## Frontend Environment Variables

### Application
```env
# .env.local
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000/api/v1
NEXT_PUBLIC_FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:3001
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENVIRONMENT=development

# Stripe (public key)
NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLIC_KEY=pk_test_xxxx
```

### Analytics
```env
# Google Analytics
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=UA-xxxxxxxxx-x

# Mixpanel
NEXT_PUBLIC_MIXPANEL_TOKEN=xxxx
```

### OAuth
```env
# Google OAuth
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=xxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com

# GitHub OAuth
NEXT_PUBLIC_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=xxxx
```

### Internationalization
```env
# i18n
NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFAULT_LOCALE=en
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPPORTED_LOCALES=en,fr,es,de
```

### Feature Flags
```env
# Feature Flags
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_MESSAGING=true
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_AI_FEATURES=false
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_MOBILE_APP=false
```

