## Docker Environment

### docker-compose.yml Variables
```yaml
environment:
  - DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:password@db:5432/kyndex_db
  - REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379
  - NODE_ENV=development
  - LOG_LEVEL=debug
```

